+# JeRyu Web Forge API
+
+The browser product uses `/api/v1` plus `/api/v1/ws`.
+
+Required endpoint groups:
+
+- `GET /api/v1/bootstrap`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos`, `POST /api/v1/repos`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/tree/{path}`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/blob/{path}`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/markdown/{path}`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-requests`
+- `GET /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-requests/{number}`
+- `POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-requests/{number}/review`
+- `POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-requests/{number}/merge`
+- `GET/PUT /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/settings`
+- `POST /api/v1/actions/preview`
+- `POST /api/v1/actions/execute`
+- `GET /api/v1/ws`
+
+Every mutation must have an action preview, risk tier, permission check, idempotency key, and audit event.
